        "slc_6c950d604c73e42ea6c2cd0a6b6575e8c9c754631eaa1684d2f17a34f17e4af6"
      ],
      "text": "Admission is governed by a memory budget rather than a fixed server count: heap tiers derive from CPG size, with LRU eviction, an RSS backstop, and an idle-TTL reaper (default 600s)."
    },
