      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_52b7d42ae79217ce43b0f47743528a8977616e20c3459f380ab8722b72fef1d7"
      ],
      "text": "CPGs are disk-cached by content hash; sleeping servers cost no RAM and wake by re-importing the cached .bin on the next query."
    },
